      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Love Energy are not the cheapest installer around but they deliver good quality systems. We found we were 'handled' by numerous people in the organisation and they were not talking to each other so we had some problems with the lack of coordination of the service provided. Even on the installlation date they cancelled as their guys walked off the job on another site. Information they posted to us took 3 weeks to arrive so we felt a little left in the dark along the way. I would recommend them for quality systems but not for their customer service.",
