      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I went through LOVE energy (1.65 ) - because they were upfront with their systems they sell - including brand, how it works - how it compares to others and why and quick to response to quote request. (This enabled myself to research further before signing up) They covered what to look for with installation (requirements), what happens if problem. Explained what they would do and process, and did everything in a timely manner - very efficient & highly professional & friendly. They suggested looking at the energy council site and other useful aspects that may not be thought of when first looking into buying solar. For example, will I need council approval (not in my area - but some are affected). I did not feel pushed into it. My aim of the system I purchased was to substantially reduce electricity bills and I think this has been achieved. I have had the system installed for 1 month and I've watched my meter go backwards (In this time I've only used 15kw).",
